.TH ATMOSPHERE 2
.SH NAME
atmosphere \- exponential density, drag, and heating utilities
.SH DESCRIPTION
The module supplies exponential density versus altitude, quadratic vector drag,
and a density-times-speed-cubed heating proxy for descent, ballistic, re-entry,
and aerobraking models.
